# The herd panel unfolded (Phone A, 2026-10-28: "Text being cut off is a bug": the unfolded panel stood above the sheep
# and cut off what was sent to the phone). Unfolded, the panel now stands beside the sheep, from the top down to the
# bottom, so the Tailshare tab shows both test texts under "Sent to this phone" without scrolling. Made-up files only
# (debug.soma.herdtest, emulator only). Run unfolded; the sheep is at 0.93 0.75 there (measured 2026-10-28).
fold open
shell setprop debug.soma.herdtest 1
shell am force-stop dev.omalauncher.boss
shell cmd statusbar collapse
launch dev.omalauncher.boss/dev.omalauncher.MainActivity
wait 2500
tap 0.93 0.75
wait 1500
tap Tailshare
wait 1500
expect test-alpha.txt
expect Sent to this phone
expect Test text one
expect Test text two
shot unfolded-tailshare-full
# The sheep stays beside the panel, not under it: a tap on it closes the panel.
tap 0.93 0.75
wait 1000
absent Tailshare
shell setprop debug.soma.herdtest 0
[phone] Unfolded on the Fold, the Herd panel stands beside the sheep and shows everything sent to the phone in his look; the cover is unchanged.
